<section id="order" class="drawer drawer-order" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="order-drawer-title" data-drawer-panel="order" hidden><header class="drawer-header"><h2 id="order-drawer-title"><span data-i18n="serviceClosed">Private closed testing</span></h2><button type="button" class="drawer-close" data-close-drawer aria-label="Close panel" data-i18n-aria="closePanel">×</button></header><div class="drawer-scroll"><div id="drawer-checkout-slot"></div></div></section>
<section id="guide" class="drawer drawer-guide" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="guide-title" data-drawer-panel="guide" hidden>
<header class="drawer-header"><h2 id="guide-title"><span data-i18n="serviceGuide">Play Console setup guide</span></h2><button type="button" class="drawer-close" data-close-drawer aria-label="Close panel" data-i18n-aria="closePanel">×</button></header><div class="drawer-scroll guide-content">
<p><span data-i18n="serviceGuideIntro">Prepare the closed track in your own account. We only need the testing link.</span></p>
<ol class="guide-steps">
<li><p><span data-i18n="serviceGroupStep">Select Google Groups under Closed testing → Testers and add this address.</span></p><div class="copy-row"><code>google-play-dev-test@googlegroups.com</code><button type="button" class="text-button" data-copy="google-play-dev-test@googlegroups.com" data-i18n="copy">Copy</button></div><details><summary data-i18n="viewScreenshot">View setup screenshot</summary><a href="assets/guides/Group.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="assets/guides/Group.png" alt="Add the tester group in the closed track" loading="lazy"></a></details></li>
<li><p><span data-i18n="serviceCountryStep">Make the track available in all countries and regions so the team can join.</span></p><details><summary data-i18n="viewScreenshot">View setup screenshot</summary><a href="assets/guides/Countries.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="assets/guides/Countries.png" alt="Track availability by country" loading="lazy"></a></details></li>
<li><p><span data-i18n="servicePublishStep">Send the changes for review. Once the track is available, copy “Join on Android”.</span></p><details><summary data-i18n="viewScreenshot">View setup screenshot</summary><a href="assets/guides/Review.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="assets/guides/Review.png" alt="Send track changes for review" loading="lazy"></a></details></li></ol>
<details><summary><span data-i18n="serviceGuidePaid">Paid app? Set up License Testing</span></summary><ol><li data-i18n="license1">Open Settings → License testing in Play Console.</li><li data-i18n="license2">Choose Google Groups and add:</li></ol><div class="copy-row"><code>google-play-dev-test@googlegroups.com</code><button type="button" class="text-button" data-copy="google-play-dev-test@googlegroups.com" data-i18n="copy">Copy</button></div><p data-i18n="license3">Keep <code>RESPOND_NORMALLY</code> and save.</p><a href="assets/guides/Settings_l.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="assets/guides/Settings_l.png" alt="License testing settings" loading="lazy"></a><a href="assets/guides/RESPOND_NORMALY_l.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="assets/guides/RESPOND_NORMALY_l.png" alt="License response and Google Group" loading="lazy"></a></details>
<div class="guide-bottom"><a class="text-button" href="https://play.google.com/console/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="openConsole">Open Play Console</a><button type="button" class="button button-outline" id="guide-return"><span data-i18n="serviceGuideBack">Back to your order</span></button></div></div></section>
